From 175e5a5616bdcbfcd1e67a588389d3050128bf87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lccc-series <series@lccc.local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:06:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden x86 differential oracle and corpus contracts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pin GNU objdump 2.47 alongside GNU as for both whole-object differential
gates, thread the selected disassembler through asmdiff, and arbitrate
allow_better verdicts with a fail-closed semantic-equality oracle: the
listing is parsed with a total line grammar, undecodable renderings and
'...' gaps of undecoded bytes refuse the whole stream, a failed
disassembler never compares equal, and both oracles' releases are named
in the summary. Validate both cached binutils executables as a pair
(anchored version tokens, as/objdump token equality, a functional canary
in both modes, validated post-install) before trusting the fast path.

Add fail-closed byte-exact annotations to encdiff rows so segment-prefix
and APX/EVEX encoding claims are checked before canonicalization or
round trips; the annotation grammar is case-insensitive and the harvest
hard-errors on conflicting or ambiguous pins. Bind the verdict baseline
to a strict parse of a digest of row identities and pins (every verdict
class exactly once, nonnegative counts, one digest line), and improve
malformed or missing baseline diagnostics.

Require the complete oracle pair in hosted/local parity checks by exact
token equality — lookalike paths, lookalike provision invocations, and
the assembler pin alike — with mutation tests covering every lookalike
shape. Complete the segment-fold and EGPR corpus coverage, cross-check
corpus annotations against the Rust encoder pins, and record both audit
adjudications with their corrections and evidence.

Verified: encdiff corpus gate green at the recorded baseline (208 rows,
BEATS=175, ORACLE-INVALID=10, ok=23, -559 B, all 16 pins live); x86-64
asm-diff 1418/1418 and i686 672/672 under the pinned pair; test_encdiff
66/66, test_asmdiff 19/19, test_ci_gate_parity 24/24, ensure_gas
self-test 12/12; fastbuild 0 warnings; rustfmt clean; clippy (lib) clean.
